WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.101 --> 00:00:03.536
-Finally,
as I mentioned earlier,

00:00:03.536 --> 00:00:07.006
a 28-year-old Latina woman
named Alexandria Ocasio-Cortez,

00:00:07.006 --> 00:00:08.975
who has never held
public office,

00:00:08.975 --> 00:00:10.977
beat the 10-term incumbent
Joe Crowley

00:00:10.977 --> 00:00:13.245
at New York's Democratic
congressional primary.

00:00:13.245 --> 00:00:16.649
Here to talk about it is one
of our writers, Jenny Hagel.

00:00:16.649 --> 00:00:20.353
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.353 --> 00:00:23.623
-Thanks, Seth.
This is so exciting.

00:00:23.623 --> 00:00:26.292
Ocasio-Cortez is Puerto Rican,
and I am, too,

00:00:26.292 --> 00:00:29.429
so in the spirit
of Latina women getting it done,

00:00:29.429 --> 00:00:31.130
I have a little message for her.

00:00:31.130 --> 00:00:33.299
Would it be okay
if I said it in Spanish?

00:00:33.299 --> 00:00:36.369
-Yeah.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:36.369 --> 00:00:38.605
Yeah, Of course,
or, por favor.

00:00:38.605 --> 00:00:39.606
[ Laughter ]

00:00:39.606 --> 00:00:40.940
-Thank you.

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.976 line:0%
[ Speaking Spanish ]

00:00:56.789 --> 00:01:00.026
[ Laughter ]

00:01:08.735 --> 00:01:10.769
-[ Laughs ]
Sí.

00:01:10.769 --> 00:01:14.773
[ Laughter and applause ]

00:01:15.241 --> 00:01:18.278 line:0%
Hey, Seth...
[ Speaking Spanish ]

00:01:20.180 --> 00:01:22.181
-[ Laughing ]
Okay!

00:01:22.181 --> 00:01:23.349
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:23.349 --> 00:01:25.518
-Yeah.

00:01:25.518 --> 00:01:27.554 line:0%
[ Speaking Spanish ]

00:01:35.762 --> 00:01:37.263 line:0%
Seth.

00:01:37.263 --> 00:01:39.599
-All right, yeah!
Give it up for Jenny over there!

00:01:39.599 --> 00:01:41.935
Keep an eye on her.
I think she's going places.

